3736 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Advanced Dashboards \046 Reports\nLeverage AI\055driven insights for a complete view of your e\055invoicing processes via comprehensive MIS dashboards and customized reports\056\n\nAutomated Error Management\nIdentify and resolve e\055invoicing errors in real time with intuitive alerts\054 bulk resubmission options\054 and guided correction tools\056\n\nEnd\055to\055End E\055Invoicing Solution\nClearTax provides a complete solution for issuing\054 submitting\054 and receiving e\055invoices\056 It tracks the status of submitted invoices sends email notification for e\055invoices\056\n\nPeppol\055Ready\nClearTax follows the Peppol specifications for data exchange\054 ensuring compliance with the UAE\031s Continuous Transaction Controls \050CTC\051 model\056\n\nDedicated customer support\nOur dedicated local support team is available 24\0577 to assist you with any E\055invoicing or integration related queries\056\n\nCompliance assurance \046 audit ready\nAssurance package covering reconciliation to prevent VAT gaps Incorporating future mandate changes\054 reducing risk of penalties and audit notices\056)
     /K [ 23 ]
